title: Roter Frontkämpferbund
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: rfb_timer <= 0
card-image: img/reichsbanner.jpg
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rfb_timer += 6; rfb_militarization_cost = 2 if rfb_militancy > 0.1 else rfb_militarization_cost = 1; rfb_militarization_cost = 3 if rfb_militancy > 0.25
max-visits: 6
#subtitle: Paramilitary organizing for the defense of the working class.

= Rotfrontkämpferbund

The *Rotfrontkämpferbund* (RFB) is our party's mass paramilitary organization, formed to defend workers' meetings, contest the streets against the SA and Stahlhelm, and stand ready should the moment for revolutionary action arrive. Unlike the bourgeois Reichsbanner, the RFB answers to the KPD alone.

[? if workers_kpd < 46 or workers_kpd < workers_nsdap or workers_kpd < workers_spd : The RFB is having a more difficult time recruiting, as the KPD is no longer the dominant party among the workers. Many of its members have drifted toward the SPD's Reichsbanner instead. ?]

- @militant: Fund more military-style training and equipment for the RFB.
- @militant_2: Use our existing resources to support more training for the RFB.
- @same: Keep the RFB as it is.
- @cut_rfb: Cut funding for the RFB.
- @women_rfb
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

#- Orient RFB towards anti-fascism (only available if we have prioritized anti fascism)

@militant
choose-if: resources >= rfb_militarization_cost
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources ([+ rfb_militarization_cost +] needed).
subtitle: -[+ rfb_militarization_cost +] resources
on-arrival: resources -= rfb_militarization_cost; rfb_investment += 1; rfb_strength += 100; rfb_militancy += 0.05; left_strength += 2; left_dissent -= 2; reformist_dissent += 5; kpd_militancy += 0.05; workers_kpd += 2*(1-dissent); unemployed_kpd += 2*(1-dissent); z_relation -= 5 if historical_mode

Some in our party decry the increasing militarization of the RFB, warning it risks provoking the state and alienating potential allies among Social Democratic workers. On the other hand, more radicalized workers are lured away from the Reichsbanner and into our ranks.

[? if historical_mode : The bourgeois press seizes on the RFB's militarization as proof of communist subversion, and relations with the Center Party sour further. ?]


@militant_2
view-if: funded_rfb >= 1
on-arrival: rfb_militancy += 0.02; funded_rfb -= 1

As we have already funded resources towards the RFB, we can invest in building up their militancy.


@same

The RFB is already serving the purpose it needs to serve. There is no reason to change what already works.

- @return: Continue...


@cut_rfb
subtitle: +1 resources
on-arrival: resources += 1; rfb_strength -= 100; rfb_militancy -= 0.05; left_strength -= 2; left_dissent -= 2; kpd_militancy -= 0.05; workers_spd += 2; unemployed_spd += 2

Cutting resources to the RFB causes a drop in membership, and leads some would-be members to join the SPD's Reichsbanner instead.